{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the violent world of Boxing.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/4412463c5d0568c403de71b344e2ec54.poster.avif?t=1764448357\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/4412463c5d0568c403de71b344e2ec54.webm?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/4412463c5d0568c403de71b344e2ec54.mp4?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Most Savage Boxing Game:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a hard game. Some boxers will die. Recruit fighters and watch them grow older. Train them, assign Perks, Fight. Unlock coaching strategies. Manage finances and upgrade your gym.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Gym:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a diverse team of boxers with unique skills and styles. Each boxer contributes to earning cash for the gym. Use cash to train your boxers and bribe the commission.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit and Customize Boxers:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the globe for the most talented fighters to join your gym. From seasoned veterans to up-and-coming prospects, every boxer has unique strengths, weaknesses, and personalities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/735421ff9077287d9001597917a1ca10.poster.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/735421ff9077287d9001597917a1ca10.webm?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/735421ff9077287d9001597917a1ca10.mp4?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dozens of Perks / Endless Boxer Builds:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks are special abilities that enhance a boxer's performance in different aspects of the game. These can range from increased stamina and power to improved defensive maneuvers or tactical advantages in the ring. As the manager,\u00a0 choose which perks to enable. Synergize perks with each boxer's talents, weaknesses, fighting style, and the gyms overall goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/ae5cbb168973ee47c162c091d103a17e.poster.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/ae5cbb168973ee47c162c091d103a17e.webm?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/ae5cbb168973ee47c162c091d103a17e.mp4?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Increasing Stats by Training:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allocate cash to increase your boxers' base stats. Each stat contributes to a boxer's overall performance in the ring and can be improved. Some stats have stars, meaning the boxer is talented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/f2971b07fa21d02f392ccdf49dc1b1e9.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a boxer sustains injuries during matches they risk death. Boxers age over time. At 60 years old one is vulnerable to death from injuries. At 100 they will die. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/cba893247eee2808dc2d74bedea3b15a.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Quests and Unlock Strategies:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quest criteria to unlock strategies that any boxer in your gym can utilize. Strategies can be changed before each round of fighting.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/7107fd46d1ab09e5989dbe840cefe6a2.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=400 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Ranking and win the Lineal Championship:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perseverance, strategy, and a little bit of luck, you'll lead your gym to greatness and cement your legacy as one of the greatest boxing managers of all time. Join the discord and share your fighters and compete in tournaments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/2d4a939a7518daf36fcd7a40d4bfb39d.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=1200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made for boxers and boxing fans by a boxer and a boxing fan. Learn about real boxing tactics, boxing history, culture and slang. Discover and challenge the easter egg boxers from the living, the dead and the fictional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Recruit a Boxer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/4dcc525ab2d5736edac690c3b1a959ad9378c742.jpg"},{"name":"Recruit 4 Fighters","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/fa0336f5417d519f512dd01a1277d615fc8f1063.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter with 2 perks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/03a94fe92f9d27011eaba70b427882234e805631.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter with 4 perks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/3605abab1be331f3164516e2da6306d6b78dd4ae.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter with 6 perks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/8f32ff6cd063292a1838b25ccee7c011e6b28ff4.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter with 8 perks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/08603f299582fda9d95ab4b7840e9214f0447371.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter with 10 perks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/21caef7c52e78644865b21d8adc5c5540df91e77.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter with max perks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/4d34f5c121662c5cee8f1be11bba805d67807dbd.jpg"},{"name":"Participate in a fight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/81e4725db88b7f6bf89341eac0548d9d54d08317.jpg"},{"name":"Win 3 Fights","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990450/35e31050ca138de5a87a792629ceb86f7dcedc7e.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2990450?t=1764448357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764448357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/68947ca4ca984ca2656820c5cc94d345a51b0479/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764448357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/68947ca4ca984ca2656820c5cc94d345a51b0479/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764448357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature Content Description\r\n\r\nThis game contains pixel-art depictions of mild blood and violence related to boxing matches. In rare instances, a boxer may suffer a fatal injury in the ring, adding a dramatic but stylized element to the game. These depictions are not graphic in nature due to the pixel art style but may still be unsettling to some players. There are no depictions of sexual content, drug use, or non-consensual violence. However, players sensitive to themes of injury or death may want to proceed with caution."},"demos":[{"appid":2990520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the violent world of Boxing.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/4412463c5d0568c403de71b344e2ec54.poster.avif?t=1764448357\" width=600 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/4412463c5d0568c403de71b344e2ec54.webm?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati