enable. Synergize perks with each boxer's talents, weaknesses, fighting style, and the gyms overall goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/ae5cbb168973ee47c162c091d103a17e.poster.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/ae5cbb168973ee47c162c091d103a17e.webm?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/ae5cbb168973ee47c162c091d103a17e.mp4?t=1764448357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Increasing Stats by Training:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allocate cash to increase your boxers' base stats. Each stat contributes to a boxer's overall performance in the ring and can be improved. Some stats have stars, meaning the boxer is talented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/f2971b07fa21d02f392ccdf49dc1b1e9.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Death:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a boxer sustains injuries during matches they risk death. Boxers age over time. At 60 years old one is vulnerable to death from injuries. At 100 they will die. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/cba893247eee2808dc2d74bedea3b15a.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete Quests and Unlock Strategies:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quest criteria to unlock strategies that any boxer in your gym can utilize. Strategies can be changed before each round of fighting.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/7107fd46d1ab09e5989dbe840cefe6a2.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=400 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Climb the Ranking and win the Lineal Championship:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With perseverance, strategy, and a little bit of luck, you'll lead your gym to greatness and cement your legacy as one of the greatest boxing managers of all time. Join the discord and share your fighters and compete in tournaments.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/extras/2d4a939a7518daf36fcd7a40d4bfb39d.avif?t=1764448357\" width=1200 height=1200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made for boxers and boxing fans by a boxer and a boxing fan. Learn about real boxing tactics, boxing history, culture and slang. Discover and challenge the easter egg boxers from the living, the dead and the fictional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["The Slanted Room"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990450/f0d97f6ad451c50c4cfaf48ee93873ef7252d9b0/header.jpg?t=1764448357","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All characters, events, and names are either fictional or used in a fictitious manner. Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, is purely coincidental.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><u